Arguments for kg_close_state:
- node_id (required): existing State or Event node
- end_date (required): ISO date, e.g. "1992-06-01"
- end_date_confidence (optional, default "operator_close")
- end_date_prose (optional): free-form prose
- force (optional, default false): allow overwriting an existing end_date
- reason (required): why the era ended; goes into kg_revision_log
- dry_run (optional): preview only
- finding_id (optional): source kg_maintenance_finding.id
